# CompatHome
## 📌 This is a web app used in finding compatable living partners based on each individuals preference and character.
A brief description of what this project is about, what problem it solves, and why it exists.
## 🚀 Features
- Easy to use.
- Simple and clear Structure.
- Lightweight and efficient.
## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- py3
- Flask(py3) for the backend, HTML, CSS and javascript for the frontend. Docker was used for conternization.
## ⚙️ Installation
Steps to install and run the project locally.
1. Clone the repository:
git clone https://github.com/username/project-name.git
2. Navigate into the project folder:
cd project-name
3. Install dependencies :
pip install -r requirements.txt
## ▶️ Usage
To run the project, extract the ZIP file, install dependencies using pip install -r requirements.txt, then run python app.py and open http://127.0.0.1:5000/ in browser.
## 🧪 Testing
Testing:Test are run using pytest. Navigate to the project directory and execute pytest to run all tests.
